  "analysis_md": "解：$OA:y=0,x$ 从 $0$ 变到 $1$；$AB:x=1,y$ 从 $0$ 变到 $1$。\n\n$$\\int_L2xy\\,dx+x^2dy=\\int_{OA}2xy\\,dx+x^2dy+\\int_{AB}2xy\\,dx+x^2dy$$\n\n$$=\\int_0^1 2x\\cdot0\\,dx+0+\\int_0^1 0+1\\,dy=0+1=1.$$",
